      <!--Q#8-->
      <exercise>
        <problem>
          <para>How does the line need to move to capture all of the points?</para>
          
        </problem>
        <solution>
          <para>Compare your answer:</para>
          <para>Answers may vary.</para>
          <para>Increase the y-intercept or the slope to capture the point \((4, 5)\).</para>
        </solution>
